@[README.md@=
# Introduction

@<introduction of litar@>

# Reference

@<reference of syntax@>

# Install

Make sure that libfuse3 is installed.

In Debian, run:

```
# apt install libfuse3-dev pkg-config libtext-template-perl
```

If there's a version of litar installed, run:

```
$ litar -m "Basics" -p "install prerequisites" litar.la | sh
```

Compile:

```
$ make
```

Test:

```
$ make hello
$ ./hello
```

Install:

```
# make install
```
@

